**/*.bak.*

# Editor / OS cruft
.idea
.vscode
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs, runtime uploads, and temporary data
**/logs
**/uploads
*.log
